<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM THE CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM THE CZECH INDOOR OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>results from the $475,000 men's Czech Open indoor tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 3-Boris Becker (Germany) -</p>
<p>walkover</p>
<p>2-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Joost Winnink</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 7-6 (7-3) 5-7 7-5</p>
<p>7-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>6-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Alex Radelescu (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat 1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
</text>
